                            </div>
                            <i class="fas fa-arrow-right" style="color:#9CA3AF;font-size:10px;margin-top:9px;"></i>
                            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#D1FAE5;font-size:11px;color:#065F46;">
                                <i class="fas fa-check" style="font-size:10px;"></i> Done — stays on server
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    {{-- NAS Mode --}}
                    <div style="padding:16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E0E7FF;background:#fff;">
                        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px;">
                            <div style="width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:8px;background:#F0FDF4;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;">
                                <i class="fas fa-network-wired" style="color:#16A34A;font-size:12px;"></i>
                            </div>
                            <p style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#14532D;margin:0;">NAS Mode — upload flow</p>
                        </div>
                        <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:10px;">
                            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#F3F4F6;font-size:11px;color:#374151;">
                                <i class="fas fa-upload" style="color:#6B7280;font-size:10px;"></i> File uploaded
                            </div>
                            <i class="fas fa-arrow-right" style="color:#9CA3AF;font-size:10px;margin-top:9px;"></i>
                            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#FEF9C3;font-size:11px;color:#854D0E;">
                                <i class="fas fa-clock" style="font-size:10px;"></i> Saved temporarily to server
                            </div>
                            <i class="fas fa-arrow-right" style="color:#9CA3AF;font-size:10px;margin-top:9px;"></i>
                            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#EEF2FF;font-size:11px;color:#4338CA;">
                                <i class="fas fa-share-nodes" style="font-size:10px;"></i> Copied to NAS via SMB
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
                            <div style="flex:1;min-width:200px;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#F0FDF4;border:1px solid #BBF7D0;">
                                <p style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#15803D;margin:0 0 4px;">Copy succeeded</p>
                                <p style="font-size:11px;color:#166534;margin:0;line-height:1.5;">Local temp file is <strong>deleted</strong>. NAS is the only copy. Path saved in database.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div style="flex:1;min-width:200px;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#FFF7ED;border:1px solid #FED7AA;">
                                <p style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#C2410C;margin:0 0 4px;">Copy failed (NAS unreachable)</p>
                                <p style="font-size:11px;color:#9A3412;margin:0;line-height:1.5;">Local file is <strong>kept</strong> as safety fallback. NAS path is not saved.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    {{-- Download flow --}}
                    <div style="padding:16px;background:#FAFAFA;">
                        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px;">
                            <div style="width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:8px;background:#F3F4F6;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;">
                                <i class="fas fa-download" style="color:#6B7280;font-size:12px;"></i>
                            </div>
                            <p style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;margin:0;">When someone opens or downloads a file</p>
                        </div>
                        <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
                            <div style="flex:1;min-width:180px;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#EEF2FF;border:1px solid #C7D2FE;">
                                <p style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#4338CA;margin:0 0 3px;"><i class="fas fa-database" style="font-size:10px;margin-right:4px;"></i>NAS path in database</p>
                                <p style="font-size:11px;color:#4338CA;margin:0;">File is fetched from NAS via SMB and served.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div style="flex:1;min-width:180px;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#F3F4F6;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;">
                                <p style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;margin:0 0 3px;"><i class="fas fa-hdd" style="font-size:10px;margin-right:4px;"></i>No NAS path</p>
                                <p style="font-size:11px;color:#6B7280;margin:0;">File is served directly from the server disk.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div style="margin-top:10px;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:7px;background:#FEF2F2;border:1px solid #FECACA;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start;">
                            <i class="fas fa-triangle-exclamation" style="color:#DC2626;font-size:11px;margin-top:2px;flex-shrink:0;"></i>
                            <p style="font-size:11px;color:#991B1B;margin:0;line-height:1.5;"><strong>Important:</strong> If you switch from NAS to Local after files were uploaded in NAS mode, those files will return a 404 error because the local copy was deleted. Always keep the NAS reachable when using NAS mode.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>

